<title>indestructotank gb - Otonic</title></head>





<body style="background-color:#000000;">

<style>
#display{
  width:480px; height:432; display:block;
  outline:3px solid #ccc; margin:5px auto;

  image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;
  image-rendering: -webkit-crisp-edges;
  image-rendering: pixelated;
  image-rendering: crisp-edges;
}
.lock-screen {
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    position: fixed;}

#io,#stack{float:left;height:480px;overflow-y:scroll}
#out{float:left;margin-right:10px}
#dbg{display:none}


</style>
<div id="dbg">
<pre id="out"></pre>
<pre id="io"></pre>
<pre id="stack"></pre>

<!--
<button onclick="cpu(); debugData(); return false">CPU Step</button>
<button onclick="requestStop ? run() : (requestStop=true); return false">Stop / Frame</button>
<button onclick="runto();return false">Run To...</button>
-->
</div>

<style>
  a:link {
    color: rgb(0, 217, 255);
    background-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  a:visited {
    color: pink;
    background-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    color: red;
    background-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  a:active {
    color: yellow;
    background-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  </style>



  <table id="gameTable">
      <tbody><tr>
        <th width="200">
          

    
          <table-layout: auto="">
            </table-layout:><table id="instructionTable">
            <tbody><tr>
              <th width="180"><b> Instructions</b></th>
            
            </tr>
            <tr>     
              <td><br>Use your enemy's own weapons against them and turn yourself into a <br><b>DEADLY PROJECTILE!</b><br><br>You're indestructible... But remember to gather enough XP before your fuel runs out!<br><br>Then purchase even<br>more enemies to smash - <br>the higher the combo,<br>the more XP you gain!<br>Good luck, pilot!<br><br></td>  
            </tr>

          
          </tbody></table>
          <table-layout: auto="">
            </table-layout:><table id="controlsTable">
            <tbody><tr>
              <th width="70px"><b>Gameboy </b></th>
              <th width="110px"><b>Keyboard</b></th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
             
              <td>(+)<br>DPAD</td>
              <td>Arrow keys<br>W A S D</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>(A)</td>
              <td>Spacebar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>(B)</td>
              <td>Spacebar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>[Start]</td>
              <td>Enter</td>

             
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>[Select]</td>
              <td>Shift</td>
            </tr>
          
          </tbody></table>
          
        </th>
        <th width="480">
          <canvas id="display" width="480" height="432" style.width="480" style.height="432" onclick="runto(0x10000);" ondblclick="fullScreen(this)"></canvas>
        </th>
        <th width="200">

          <table-layout: auto="">
              </table-layout:><a target="_blank" href="https://antonylavelle.itch.io/indestructotank-gb">
                  <img width="200&quot;" height="250" alt="Click to visit the itch.io page" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=getBackupImage();this.width=150;this.height=47" data-w2s-src="/images/boxtile.jpg">
                  <img>
                  
               </a><br>IndestructoTank! Isn't just a browser based game - click above to get the ROM and play it on original Gameboy hardware!<br><br><table id="headingTable">
            <tbody><tr>
                
                
              </tr>
              <tr>
                
              </tr>

            
              <tr>
